<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S12" title="In Circuit Tracing in Vision–Language Models:Understanding the Internal Mechanisms of Multimodal Thinking" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">12 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
